am","category":"park","tags":["nature","photo"],"location":{"lat":21.12823,"lng":79.0577},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"nagpur_wv_ramdham","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.rajkamalresorts.com","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21"},"hashtags":["ramdhamnagpur","nagpur"],"bestLight":"golden","summary":"Central India's largest spiritual - cultural tourism park which houses all Hindu deities under one roof. There are cultural shows like folk dances, magic and puppet shows every evening and tourists can look forward for a comfortable stay at the resort.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Nagpur","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Statue_of_Br._Moreshwar_Abhyankar_-_panoramio.jpg/1280px-Statue_of_Br._Moreshwar_Abhyankar_-_panoramio.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Statue_of_Br._Moreshwar_Abhyankar_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Statue_of_Br._Moreshwar_Abhyankar_-_panoramio.jpg","w":1200,"h":1603,"author":"Ganesh Dhamodkar","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Statue_of_Br._Moreshwar_Abhyankar_-_panoramio.jpg"}},{"id":"nagpur_wv_satpuda_botanical_garden","areaId":"nagpur","name":"Satpuda Botanical Garden","category":"park","tags":["nature","photo"],"location":{"lat":21.15733,"lng":79.03979},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"nagpur_wv_satpuda_botanical_garden","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21"},"hashtags":["satpudabotanicalgarden","nagpur"],"bestLight":"golden","summary":"The botanical garden of Nagpur with several rare plant species. The garden is also popular among bird enthusiasts.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Nagpur"},{"id":"nagpur_lok_bhavan","areaId":"nagpur","name":"Lok Bhavan","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"locatio